Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:31:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cecd: Drop StreetPass boxes without MBoxInfo from the
 MBoxList

System Settings showed an extra, empty StreetPass icon: the MBoxList
named a box whose folder had no MBoxInfo____ (or no longer existed after
a box was deleted or StreetPass data was cleared).

- Only box folders with a MBoxInfo____ go into the list, including the
  title writing it.
- The list is cleaned when CECD starts, when a title opens or reads it
  and after a box (or its MBoxInfo) is deleted, like the real module.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
